# WIDS

A rule-based Wireless Intrusion Detection System for monitoring IEEE 802.11 Wi-Fi environments.

## Current Development Phase

- Ubuntu development environment configured
- GitHub repository connected using SSH
- Clean project structure initialized
- Python development environment configured

## Planned Technology Stack

